{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-x050","book":"higher-math-9-10-bn","subject":"higher-math","classLevel":"9-10","trust":"page-checked","chapter":5,"chapterTitle":"সমীকরণ","topic":"5.ex","pages":[120,120],"type":"mcq","text":"৪. একটি সংখ্যা ও ঐ সংখ্যার গুণাত্মক বিপরীত সংখ্যার সমষ্টি ৬। সম্ভাব্য সমীকরণটির গঠন হবে\n(i) $x + \\frac{1}{x} = 6$\n(ii) $x^2 + 1 = 6x$\n(iii) $x^2 - 6x - 1 = 0$\nনিচের কোনটি সঠিক?\nক) $i$ ও $ii$ খ) $i$ ও $iii$ গ) $ii$ ও $iii$ ঘ) $i, ii$ ও $iii$","passageIds":["higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p055","higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p056","higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p057","higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p058","higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p059"]}
{"id":"higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-x051","book":"higher-math-9-10-bn","subject":"higher-math","classLevel":"9-10","trust":"page-checked","chapter":5,"chapterTitle":"সমীকরণ","topic":"5.ex","pages":[121,121],"type":"short","text":"৫. $2^{px-1} = 2^{2px-2}$ এর সমাধান কোনটি?\nক) $\\frac{p}{2}$ খ) $p$ গ) $-\\frac{p}{2}$ ঘ) $\\frac{1}{p}$","passageIds":["higher-math-9-10-bn-c05-t5.ex-p060"]}
